<title>USA: AmTrust Capital Corp Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>AmTrust Capital Corp Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PERU, Ind. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmTrust Capital Corp on Monday reported a loss of $89,000 for the first quarter ended September 30 compared with a profit of $61,000 for the same quarter in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said the $150,000 decrease was due to a one-time pre-tax special charge of $295,000.</p>
<p>It did not give per share figures.</p>
</text>
